This is not my first ascension but it is my first ascension post so
I'm not sure how to label this. Anyway I don't really keep any notes
when I play and I don't know how to get those cool screen shots
everyone else seems to get but I hope you will enjoy. 

Round was created randomly and started out as a female samurai. The
original plan was to quickly find a long sword and get excalibur and
some decent armor, to do this I decided to head for mine town. On my
way I stumbled upon a bones file from a failed monk who's corpse had
little of value except a robe and a magic whistle. Before I could get
to mines town i fell through a couple of trap doors and almost got to
mine send. On my hard (pet-less) climb upwards I came across a
peaceful elf zombie and a quick search of the area showed a poly-trap.

I tamed a new pet and poly'd him to an ice troll. With my new friend I
continued up to mine town. Here I found a magic lamp and made my first
mistake of the game. I had the troll kill every shopkeeper (except
one) before i had price-id'd my scrolls. The RNG punished this mistake
by not creating another general or book store for the rest of the
game. Anyway, the money earned from the murderous rampage bought some
points of protection. 

After this I climbed back to the main dungeon and continued to
Sokoban. On the way I found a BoH and luckily Sokoban gave me a "oR. I
got Snickersnee through saccing and continued down the dungeon with
the help of my troll until I accidently displaced him into a spiders
web. The magic-traps, falling rock-traps etc i had displaced him into
earlier hadn't bothered him but apparently this was the straw that
broke the camels back and the troll became hostile. He nearly killed
me but i managed to escape upstairs.

Now I was faced with a problem, how do i get rid of a former pet
troll? I couldn't sacrifice him, I couldn't eat him (maybe the only
penalty is to get aggravate monster, but I weren't sure and didn't
feel like looking it up.) and I didn't have a tinning kit. Suddenly I
remembered the poly-trap and went back to the mines to get a decent
pet with an appetite. On my way there I tamed three cats and managed
to poly them into 2 large black dragons and one baby black dragon. I
thought this was so cute I named them Mamma, Pappa, Barn (swedish for
Mom, Dad, Child and also the swedish name for the kids game i believe
americans call "house"). 

While I was visiting i cleaned out mines end (wine cellar) since I'd
forgotten to do so before. I went back to the troll and he was taken
care of without any trouble. Continuing down I came across the big
room where Mamma and Barn bit the dust. Although saddened by the loss
of his family Pappa continued to follow me on my journey.

On my way to the castle I came across another bones file which
(unfortunately) contained a gray dragon scale mail (it gives me more
satisfaction killing a dragon myself and getting the scales from him),
speed boots and a /oW. Medusa was crossed with the help of Wand of
colds and scrolls of earth. After that I came to a throne room and got
a wish. I spent a couple of minutes deciding if I should go wishless
or not but finally decided that since I already ascended a wishless
and genoless samurai this one was just for fun and wished for 2
blessed scrolls of charging. Around this time I also got to genocide
Arch-liches.

The Castle was no problem although Pappa followed his family to black
dragon heaven. By this time I had got to experience level 14 and went
up to do the quest. My nemesis was not a problem thanks to a /oD I had
found earlier (I've made the mistake of fighting him before, ended up
bisected with 3 unused /oW i my BoH).

After this I did some alchemy and sacced to get Grayswandir (and
Trollsbane). Cleared out the first few levels of hell until I realized
I forgot to get fire resistance (d'oh). Wished for a blessed tin of
red dragon meat and continued. Hell is much more fun since I realized
I don't have to explore it, just find the shortest way from the up to
the down stairs. I marked the vibrating square and returned to the
land of the living to do some last minute polying and alchemy. I also
dipped to get excalibur and while doing so got a wish. Not knowing
what to wish for (I already had a complete AK) I wished for a blessed
figurine of an archon.

Me and my archon got the book, and later the amulet without any
trouble. The mysterious force was not nearly as big a nuance as the
fact that the archon refused to stand next to me on the upstairs.

The planes were also trouble free and the first altar I tried (Death
)was the right one. Standing on the alatar I put on a "o Changing and
turned male and wished for a total of 5 blessed figurines of succubus
(got pets from 4) and one blessed figurine of a wood/water nymph (I
apologize to all the women here but it would have felt strange being
female and having a male harem). I tried to ascend with all of them
but since I also had my guardian angel and the archon I couldn't get
them all to stand next to me. I ended up with only 3 of the succubus
and the angel.

